     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Film modeling powered by spektrafilm (Andrea Volpato, https://github.com/andreavolpato/spektrafilm), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). Modified by Thomas Hammoudi: input = Adobe Standard rendering with its ACR3 tone curve undone, print relative to paper white, 32x32x32 table. https://github.com/ThomasHMD/SpektraLR</rdf:li>
